<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnSegmentsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">7. The Board of Directors of the Company in their meeting on April 26, 2021 had approved a Scheme of Amalgamation of its wholly owned subsidiary Sagar Cements (R) Limited (SCRL) with the Company subject to necessary approval from the authorities concerned under section 230 and 232 of the Companies Act 2013. The Merger application has since been filed with the Hon’ble National Company Law Tribunal on July 12, 2021. Upon approval of the Scheme by the concerned authorities, Sagar Cements (R) Limited will get merged itself with the Company with effect from the Appointed Date of March 30, 2021 or such other date as the Hon’ble National Company Law Tribunal may approve. Pending such approval, the standalone financial results of the Company for the quarter ended June 30, 2021, quarter and year ended March 31, 2021 are presented without giving effect to the said merger.      8. The Board of Directors, at their meeting held on July 01, 2021, recommended the splitting of equity shares of the Company from existing face value of Rs 10/- each to face value of Rs 2/- each (i.e. split of 1 equity share of Rs 10/ - each into 5 equity shares of Rs 2/- each). The recommendation is subject to approval by the shareholders in the Annual General Meeting of the Company held on July 28, 2021, the outcome of voting of which is awaited.      9. The figures for the quarter ended March 2021 are the balancing figures between the audited figures in respect of the full financial year ended March 2021 and the published year to date figures up to third quarter ended December 31, 2020.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnSegmentsExplanatoryTextBlock>
